Spec: Project/Modules

Purpose:
  Declares each domain module: what it owns, its public surface, and its
  direct dependencies. This is the boundary contract ExtractCheck
  (architecture.sdd) validates against.

M {
  user {
    r:   user-management
    owns: user
    api: public
  }

  course {
    r:    course-management
    owns: course
    api:  public
    deps: user
  }

  payment {
    r:    payment-processing
    owns: payment
    api:  public
    deps: course, user
    ext:  PaymentGateway        # external integration, see integrations.sdd
  }
}

Rule:
  A module MAY depend on modules listed in `deps`.
  A module MUST NOT depend on any module not listed in `deps`
  (undeclared dependency = architecture violation, see architecture.sdd).
